function propertyChecksum(value){let hash=2166136261;for(let i=0;i<String(value).length;i++){hash^=String(value).charCodeAt(i);hash=Math.imul(hash,16777619)}return (hash>>>0).toString(16)}
function validatePropertyCollection(collection){if(!Array.isArray(collection))throw new Error('Property collection is not an array.');const ids=new Set();collection.forEach((property,index)=>{if(!property||typeof property!=='object')throw new Error(`Property ${index+1} is invalid.`);const id=String(property.id||'');if(!id)throw new Error(`Property ${index+1} is missing an ID.`);if(ids.has(id))throw new Error(`Duplicate property ID: ${id}`);ids.add(id);if(!validUsCoordinate(property.lat,property.lng))throw new Error(`Property ${id} has invalid coordinates.`)});return true}
function setPersistenceStatus(message,kind='saved'){const el=document.getElementById('persistenceStatus');if(!el)return;el.textContent=message;el.dataset.state=kind;if(kind==='saved')clearStoragePressureNotice()}
function restoreInMemoryCollection(payload){try{const parsed=JSON.parse(payload||'[]'),normalized=normalizeStartupCollection(parsed);if(normalized)properties=mergeSeed(normalized).map((item,index)=>normalizeRecord(item,index))}catch{}}
function saveFailureDetails(error){return window.OTSaveReliability?.failureDetails?.(error)||{code:'unknown-save-error',label:'Unknown save error',message:'The property was not changed. Retry the save or download an emergency copy of this edit.'}}
function save({backup=false,reason='Property update',collection=properties,activePropertyId='',recalculate=true}={}){
 if(!persistenceReady)return true;
 const started=performance.now(),previousInMemory=properties;
 let priorPayload=null,primaryWriteStarted=false,prepared=null;
 try{priorPayload=localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY)}catch(error){error.code='storage-unavailable';const details=saveFailureDetails(error);lastPropertySaveFailure={reason,details,error:String(error?.message||error)};setPersistenceStatus(details.label,'failed');window.OTDiagnostics?.recordSave?.({reason,durationMs:performance.now()-started,success:false,error:String(error?.message||error),category:details.code});return false}
 try{
  setPersistenceStatus('Saving…','saving');
  prepared=window.OTSaveReliability?.prepareCollection?.(collection)||{collection:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(collection)),payload:JSON.stringify(collection),bytes:JSON.stringify(collection).length,issues:[]};
  validatePropertyCollection(prepared.collection);
  const recovery=backup?snapshot(reason):createRecoverySnapshot(`Before ${reason}`);
  if(!recovery){const error=lastRecoverySnapshotFailure||new Error('Recovery snapshot could not be created; the save was cancelled to protect existing data.');if(!error.code)error.code='recovery-snapshot';throw error}
  const checksum=propertyChecksum(prepared.payload);
  window.OTSaveReliability?.preflightStorageWrite?.(localStorage,{[STORAGE_KEY]:prepared.payload});
  primaryWriteStarted=true;
  localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY,prepared.payload);
  const confirmed=localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
  if(!confirmed||propertyChecksum(confirmed)!==checksum){const error=new Error('Canonical storage verification failed.');error.code='temporary-verification';throw error}
  const confirmedCollection=JSON.parse(confirmed);
  validatePropertyCollection(confirmedCollection);
  if(activePropertyId&&!confirmedCollection.some(property=>String(property.id)===String(activePropertyId))){const error=new Error('The active property could not be read back after the verified save.');error.code='temporary-verification';throw error}
  properties=prepared.collection;
  if(activePropertyId&&recalculate)queueMicrotask(()=>scheduleSimplifiedScoreRecalculation(activePropertyId,reason));
  try{localStorage.removeItem(TEMP_PROPERTY_KEY);writeSmallState(LAST_KNOWN_COUNT_KEY,String(properties.length));writeSmallState(LAST_VERIFIED_SAVE_KEY,new Date().toISOString())}catch(metadataError){console.warn('Operation Turtle saved property data, but could not update noncritical save metadata.',metadataError)}
  lastPropertySaveFailure=null;
  setPersistenceStatus('Saved locally','saved');
  window.OTDiagnostics?.recordSave?.({reason,durationMs:performance.now()-started,propertyCount:properties.length,bytes:prepared.bytes,success:true,removedRuntimeValues:prepared.issues?.length||0});
  return true;
 }catch(error){
  try{localStorage.removeItem(TEMP_PROPERTY_KEY)}catch{}
  if(primaryWriteStarted){try{if(priorPayload===null)localStorage.removeItem(STORAGE_KEY);else localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY,priorPayload)}catch(restoreError){console.error('Operation Turtle could not restore the pre-save property payload.',restoreError)}}
  properties=previousInMemory;
  const details=saveFailureDetails(error);
  lastPropertySaveFailure={reason,details,error:String(error?.message||error),at:new Date().toISOString(),bytes:prepared?.bytes||0};
  setPersistenceStatus(details.label,'failed');showStoragePressureNotice(details);
  window.OTDiagnostics?.recordSave?.({reason,durationMs:performance.now()-started,propertyCount:previousInMemory.length,success:false,error:String(error?.message||error),category:details.code});
  if(window.OTDiagnostics?.enabled)console.error('Operation Turtle property save failed:',error);
  return false;
 }
}
